  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">単元株式数100株</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesLessThanOneUnitMember">１単元(100株)未満の株式</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
